<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistani rupee closing rates in kerb market.</title>
<headline>Pakistani rupee closing rates in kerb market.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wednesday's spot rupee rates in kerb market from Khanani &amp; Kalia Int'l (Pvt) Ltd:</p>
<p>				buying rate	 selling rate</p>
<p>    U.S. dollar	   41.40		 41.45</p>
<p>    Pound sterling	66.60		 66.70</p>
<p>    Deutsche mark	 24.40		 24.45</p>
<p>    Japanese yen	   0.333		 0.335</p>
<p>    Saudi riyal	   11.00		 11.02</p>
<p>    UAE dirham	    11.25		 11.27</p>
<p>    Indian rupee	   1.08		  1.10</p>
<p>    F.E.B.C.		 3.75 pct	    4.00 pct</p>
</text>
